 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_4",
   "t": "Mr Webb? Come this way, I'll take your blood pressure and pulse before the doctor. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Right. Quick as you can, I've left my car on a meter. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_4",
   "t": "138 over 84, pulse 78.",
   "pause": 15.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Hello, Mr Webb, and I see you've brought your daughter. Tell me what's going on. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Dad won't make a fuss, so I'm going to. His bowels have changed, doctor. He's sixty, and he's been going more often."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "It's nothing, I've had a funny tummy, that's all. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Mr Webb, how long has this been?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Two months. Perhaps three."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "How has it changed?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Looser. More often, three or four times a day instead of once. And I get this urgency, I have to run."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any blood in the stool?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No. No blood."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any weight loss?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Not that I've noticed."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "He's lost weight, doctor, his trousers are loose."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'll weigh him, and I'll note that you each said different things. What tablets are you on?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Ramipril, 5 mg once a day. And a statin, simvastatin, 20 mg, at night."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "He forgets the statin most nights, doctor."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I don't forget it, I choose not to."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Okay, noted that. Any allergies?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No allergies."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Medical history?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "High blood pressure, high cholesterol, and I had a bit of gout once."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Do you smoke or drink?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Smoked until the nineties. And a pint with my tea on Fridays."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Right. A change in bowel habit over sixty, with possible weight loss, needs checking properly, even if it turns out to be nothing. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I knew you'd say that. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like to arrange a stool test, called a FIT test, to look for hidden blood."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "And a scan? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And I'd like to refer him for a colonoscopy, a camera test of the bowel, which is the best way to look."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A camera up there? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Under sedation. It's the best test, and it's very common. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_4",
   "t": "I'll book the stool kit for you, Mr Webb, and give you the leaflet. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Please drink plenty, and note your toilet habits for me in a little diary."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A diary of my bowels. Lovely. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "I'll help you, Dad. ~"
  }
 ],
